OL,3,GNEWSATwo murderers left inmate with
OL,4,Apunctured lung
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo young murderers left a fellow
OL,7,Finmate with a punctured lung in a
OL,8,Fstabbing with improvised weapons, a
OL,9,Fcourt has heard.
OL,11,FShawn Spence, 20, and Kai Howitt, 21,
OL,12,Fattacked a man in HMP Deerbolt at
OL,13,FBarnard Castle, County Durham, in April
OL,14,F2025, Durham Crown Court heard.
OL,16,FBoth were serving life sentences for
OL,17,Fmurder, the court heard, with Judge
OL,18,FJoanne Kidd saying Spence clearly
OL,19,Fthought himself "above the law".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
