OL,3,GNEWSATwo murderers left inmate with
OL,4,Apunctured lung
OL,5,
OL,6,FEach admitted inflicting grievous
OL,7,Fbodily harm, with Spence jailed for a
OL,8,Ffurther four years and Howitt for three
OL,9,Fyears seven months. A third inmate,
OL,10,FJames Morton, 21, who was serving a
OL,11,Fsentence for wounding, was jailed for
OL,12,Ffour months for punching the inmate as
OL,13,Fhe fled the two attackers.
